(!******************************************************
   Mosel Example Problems
   ======================

   file nrm_10_4_1.mos
   ```````````````````
   MAXSAT solving with Mosel.

   -- Mosel version of the problem instance normalized-mds_10_4_1.opb --
      Source: http://www.cril.univ-artois.fr/PB07/

